  "result": "The per-person list is decided by `visibleNav()` in `src/config/nav.ts`. It walks the `SIDEBAR_NAV` and `SETTINGS_NAV` trees and keeps an item only if `can(actor, item.action, …)` passes and its `flag`, if any, is enabled for the org's snapshot. Because the check is per actor, admins and viewers get different lists. Plan-gated entries drop out when their feature flag is off for that org. The file doesn't branch on `actor.role`; the role difference comes through `can()` in `src/lib/permissions.ts`, and the plan difference comes through the flag snapshot and `isEnabled()` in `src/lib/feature-flags.ts`. Neither of those decides the list itself.\n\n`src/components/domain/nav/app-sidebar.tsx` only calls `visibleNav()` and renders the result.\n\nANSWER: src/config/nav.ts",
